{'symbol': 'BG', 'date': '2023-04-26 16:05:00', 'title': 'BUNGE LIMITED TO HOLD VIRTUAL-ONLY ANNUAL GENERAL MEETING', 'text': 'ST. LOUIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BUNGE LIMITED (NYSE: BG) WILL HOLD ITS ANNUAL GENERAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS ON THURSDAY, MAY 11, 2023 AT 11:00 A.M. CENTRAL TIME. THE MEETING WILL BE “VIRTUAL-ONLY” AND WILL BE CONDUCTED EXCLUSIVELY ONLINE VIA LIVE AUDIO WEBCAST THAT CAN BE ACCESSED AT WWW.VIRTUALSHAREHOLDERMEETING.COM/BG2023. IN ORDER TO VOTE THEIR SHARES OR SUBMIT QUESTIONS AT THE ANNUAL GENERAL MEETING, SHAREHOLDERS SHOULD ENTER THE CONTROL NUMBER INCLUDED IN THE PROXY MATERIALS OR ON THE PROXY.'}